abstract: >
  BOS Platform implements the Black Soldier Fly (BSF) bioconversion
  case study via a five-endpoint causal inference layer
  (/api/v1/causal/identify, /estimate, /refute, /mediation,
  /sensitivity) backing Paper 1 (J Clean Prod, in preparation). The
  mediation endpoint operationalises Pearl/Rubin counterfactual
  mediation analysis (NDE/NIE decomposition) over the
  Signal-API -> kappa -> SER pathway. The sensitivity endpoint
  operationalises the paper's Gamma-bound >= 1.5 falsification gate
  via VanderWeele-Ding E-value (primary, DoWhy 0.14
  EValueSensitivityAnalyzer) with a self-implemented Chinn-VWD
  fallback and an additional Cinelli-Hazlett robustness value branch
  for linear-bound analysis.
